# Bringer of the Last Gift makes each player sacrifice all their other creatures at once (CR 701.21a, 101.4), so Bot2's two Ornithopters
# (artifact creatures) and Bot1's own Vengeful Tracker leave together. Leaves-the-battlefield abilities look back (CR 603.10a), so the
# Tracker sees both sacrifices and triggers twice, dealing 2 damage to Bot2 each time as it last existed (CR 608.2h): Bot2 is on 16.
# Bot1's own Tracker being sacrificed with them is no artifact sacrificed by an opponent. Black Lotus pays three of the eight mana.

